Package: jaspRobust
Type: Package
Title: Robust Statistics Module for JASP
Version: 0.97.0
Date: 2026-06-09
Author: Johnny van Doorn, JASP Team
Website: jasp-stats.org
Maintainer: Johnny van Doorn <j.b.vandoorn@uva.nl>
Description: Robust statistical analyses for JASP. Covers robust ANOVA, ANCOVA, and repeated measures ANOVA based on trimmed means, medians, and percentile-bootstrap methods from the WRS2 package; robust linear regression via M- and MM-estimation from MASS::rlm; and robust correlation (percentage bend, Winsorized).
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
  ggplot2,
  jaspBase,
  jaspDescriptives,
  jaspGraphs,
  jaspTTests,
  MASS,
  WRS2
Remotes:
  jasp-stats/jaspBase,
  jasp-stats/jaspDescriptives,
  jasp-stats/jaspGraphs,
  jasp-stats/jaspTTests
